  "source": "IPIP 50-item Big-Five Factor Markers (Goldberg, 1992; ipip.ori.org, public domain). Factor 4 is keyed here as Neuroticism (reverse of Emotional Stability). Factor 5 = Intellect/Imagination, used as Openness.",
